# VibeServe — Deep System Audit Report

## 0. Repository Overview

VibeServe is a monorepo of 120 commits containing three pillars: [github](https://github.com/ncsound919/VibeServe)
- **`vibeserve/`** — Python FastMCP server with 28 tools, LLM routing, WCAG validation, memory/cache
- **`ide/`** — React 19 + Vite 6 + Hono frontend IDE with Monaco editor, WebSocket streaming, and Electron packaging
- **`orchestrator/`** — Listed in the README but **does not exist as a real directory**; the path returns a 404 [github](https://github.com/ncsound919/VibeServe/tree/main/orchestrator)

