## 5. Orchestrator Layer

The `orchestrator/` directory listed in the repo root sidebar and in the README returns a **GitHub 404** — it does not exist as a committed directory. The orchestration role is split across: [github](https://github.com/ncsound919/VibeServe/tree/main/orchestrator)
- `ide/src/server/pipelineQueue.ts` — BullMQ-based job queue
- `ide/src/server/schedulerService.ts` — cron scheduler
- `ide/src/services/pipelineService.ts` — pipeline runner
- `vibeserve/tools/agenda.py` — Python-side goal tracking

The README's 3-pillar description (ide / orchestrator / mcp) is **architecturally inaccurate** for the current state of the repo.

